        "question": "Explain the fundamental architecture and lifecycle of an application in DevOps, Platform Engineering & SRE.",
        "answer": "In DevOps, Platform Engineering & SRE, applications follow a standard lifecycle comprising architectural design, development, local verification, continuous integration testing, containerized packaging, automated cloud deployment, and continuous runtime observability. At runtime, requests enter through load balancers or gateways, pass through authentication and business logic layers, interact with persistence systems, and return deterministic responses.",
