            "heading": "1. Core Architectural Pillars of Domain Introduction & Strategic Foundations",
            "content": "In modern IT Training & Technical Education, mastering domain introduction & strategic foundations is essential for building robust, scalable applications. Systems must be engineered with explicit separation of concerns, decoupling transport protocols from core domain business rules. By adhering to clean architecture patterns, software engineers ensure high testability and seamless cloud migration."
