        "question": "What is Data Governance, Quality & Observability and what core business problem does it solve in modern enterprise IT?",
        "answer": "Data Governance, Quality & Observability is the discipline responsible for engineering, deploying, and maintaining software and infrastructure systems dedicated to this domain. It solves the critical bottleneck of building scalable, reliable, and secure technology products that support business operations, user transactions, and data intelligence. Without this domain, organizations struggle with manual operational overhead, fragile systems, and an inability to scale to modern internet traffic.",
