        "level": "Intermediate",
        "category": "Testing & Quality Assurance",
        "question": "[Intermediate Q6] How do you architect Testing & Quality Assurance to maintain high resilience in Cloud FinOps & Sustainable Infrastructure?",
        "answer": "Architecting testing & quality assurance in Cloud FinOps & Sustainable Infrastructure requires applying defensive engineering patterns: circuit breakers to stop cascading failures, structured retries with exponential backoff and jitter, rate limiting at gateway ingress, and comprehensive health check probes. By isolating failing dependencies, the core system continues serving degraded traffic without crashing entirely.",
